# Note: CLAUDE.md, docs/, .claude/ (except settings.local.json) and skills-lock.json
# must stay tracked. Never ignore the whole `.claude/` folder, and never add `!`
# re-include rules for it: they would override the secret and cache patterns above.
# Check with: git check-ignore -v .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md  (must print nothing)
